# phi-agent — A1 (assistant) perimeter.
#
# Recomputed per active project: no other project is visible. The active
# project name comes from PHI_AGENT_PROJECT; when unset, @PROJECT@ lines
# expand to an empty path and are skipped, so the container starts without a
# project selected.
#
# Ordering: the writable XDG bind comes first; every memoria.md is then
# re-bound read-only over it. memoria.md at all three levels (system,
# personality, project) stays read-only: the agent CANNOT write its own
# memory, enforced by these mounts, not by the interface. Only `phi agent
# memory accept` (outside the containment) promotes a proposte/ file into
# memoria.md.
#
# Re-binding each personalita/<name>/proposte/ writable and the read-only
# folders of interest from <project>/folders.list are done in phi-agent-contain
# because the .paths grammar has no globs or lists.

# A1's own XDG trees — writable. opencode keeps its sessions, auth, cache.
rw   @AGENT_DATA@                @CONTAINER_HOME@/.local/share
rw   @AGENT_STATE@               @CONTAINER_HOME@/.local/state
rw   @AGENT_CACHE@               @CONTAINER_HOME@/.cache

# System memory — read-only. Written only by `phi agent memory accept
# --level system`. "?" so a machine that has never run `phi agent init` still
# starts.
ro?  @AGENT_DATA@/memoria.md     @CONTAINER_HOME@/.local/share/memoria.md

# The engine config, read-only. A single file, not the whole .config dir.
# "?" — you create it from opencode.example.json (it carries the model id).
ro?  @AGENT_CONFIG@/opencode/opencode.json   @CONTAINER_HOME@/.config/opencode/opencode.json

# Personalities — read-only. The agent never writes here. This re-binds the
# SAME container path (already exposed writable via @AGENT_DATA@ above)
# read-only. phi-agent-contain then re-binds each <name>/proposte/ writable.
ro?  @AGENT_DATA@/personalita    @CONTAINER_HOME@/.local/share/personalita

# The active project. Everything read-only except the two write areas.
ro?  @PROJECT@                   @CONTAINER_HOME@/project
ro?  @PROJECT@/memoria.md        @CONTAINER_HOME@/project/memoria.md
rw?  @PROJECT@/proposte          @CONTAINER_HOME@/project/proposte
rw?  @PROJECT@/output            @CONTAINER_HOME@/project/output
